<title>ITALY: Italy records BOP deficit in March.</title>
<headline>Italy records BOP deficit in March.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's overall balance of payments recorded a 3.896 trillion lire deficit in March, the Italian Foreign Exchange Office said.</p>
<p>BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (In billions of lire)</p>
<p>			     March 97     Feb 97    March 96</p>
<p> Total		     -3,896	 -1,957   +1,340</p>
<p>  -Year to date	    -531	 +3,365     +416</p>
<p> Capital movements	 -192	   +571   +5,589</p>
<p>  -Year to date	 +13,137	+13,329   +4,178</p>
